the composition <MATH_0015> is also of finite type,\nsee Morphisms, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0016> be a category fibred in groupoids.\nLet <MATH_0017> be an object of <MATH_0018> which lies over <MATH_0019>. Denote <MATH_0020>\nthe pullback of <MATH_0021> by <MATH_0022>. By the <MATH_0023>-Yoneda lemma <MATH_0024> corresponds\nto a <MATH_0025>-morphism\n<MATH_0026>\nsee Algebraic Stacks, Section <REF_0004>. We obtain a\nmorphism of predeformation categories\n<MATH_0027>\nover <MATH_0028> see (<REF_0005>).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b3e31615f81d951db2d679ceceff11aa03a0468c2400ffdabd68cc10e9e4f4b", "unit_id": "tag:07XD:prose-0002"}
